keywords:
  - finite state machines
  - large language models
  - behavioral correctness
  - model-based testing
  - robustness
  - reproducibility
  - empirical software engineering
abstract: >
  behavioral-fsm-benchmark v0.1.0 provides an offline Python evaluation framework
  and an approved gold corpus (three pilot and nine core systems) extending
  FSM-Bench-20 with behavioral oracles, guard-aware determinism (G3a),
  gold reference FSMs, test-suite agreement, coverage metrics, and corpus-level
  validation tooling for empirical software engineering research.
